ld have been) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"2:103"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّوْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"2:103"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"2:103"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:103"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٠٣","en_gloss":"(103)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:103"}]},{"verse_key":"2:104","surah":2,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَقُولُوا۟ رَٰعِنَا وَقُولُوا۟ ٱنظُرْنَا وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۗ وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, do not say [to the Prophet], ‘Raina,’ but say, ‘Unzurna,’ and listen [to him]: an agonizing torment awaits those who ignore [God’s words].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَٰعِنَا","en_gloss":"Raina","transliteration":"rāʿinā","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"waqūlū","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱنظُرْنَا","en_gloss":"Unzurna","transliteration":"unẓur'nā","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"and listen","transliteration":"wa-is'maʿū","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"And for the disbelievers","transliteration":"walil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"2:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:104"}]},{"verse_key":"2:105","surah":2,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"مَّا يَوَدُّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَلَا ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ أَن يُنَزَّلَ عَلَيْكُم مِّنْ خَيْرٍ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَخْتَصُّ بِرَحْمَتِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Neither those People of the Book who disbelieve nor the idolaters would like anything good to be sent down to you from your Lord, but God chooses for His grace whoever He will: His bounty has no limits.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَوَدُّ","en_gloss":"like","transliteration":"yawaddu","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَهْلِ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahli","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"those who associate partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُنَزَّلَ","en_gloss":"(there should) be sent down","transliteration":"yunazzala","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَيْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"khayrin","verse_key":"2:105"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss